1
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:21,290
Let's help the director

2
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:23,290
run through Xiao Qian's dance.

3
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,080
Get yourselves familiar with the music again.

4
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:25,480
Okay.

5
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,480
Sure, no problem.

6
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:34,560
Director,

7
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,340
everyone is ready.

8
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,120
Don't be nervous.

9
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:39,240
It'll be fine.

10
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:43,970
Let's start.

11
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,090
Hold on a second.

12
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:54,120
So,

13
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:56,240
during that move just now,

14
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:57,920
it should glide over the head.

15
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:01,000
Okay.

16
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:02,640
Let's try that again.

17
00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:04,920
Music!

18
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:15,120
Hold on a sec.

19
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:16,560
Director,

20
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:18,039
that squatting move just now

21
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:19,080
needs to be a bit faster.

22
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:22,080
Otherwise, it's easy to fall behind on the floorwork.

23
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:23,360
Okay.

24
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,160
Let's do it once more.

25
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:27,000
Music!

26
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:43,680
Stop.

27
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:47,680
Feixin,

28
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:50,539
how do you think I'm doing now?

29
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:53,200
You've already made some progress.

30
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:55,479
Xiao Qi,

31
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,880
could you dance a bit slower later?

32
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:58,920
I can't quite keep up.

33
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,320
Okay.

34
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,720
Director,

35
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,400
should we take a break first?

36
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,200
Okay.

37
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,260
Let's take a break.

38
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,580
Let's rest for a while.

39
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:34,400
Alright, you can go first.

40
00:02:34,400 --> 00:02:35,880
I need to talk to her alone.

41
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:38,120
I'll call you if I need anything.

42
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,290
Have a good chat.

43
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,220
The weather is really nice today.

44
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:53,600
It's been a long time since I saw such a blue sky,

45
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,720
just like when we were in college.

46
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,600
Alright.

47
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,130
I know what you're going to say.

48
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:08,330
Did you prepare a bunch of words to comfort me?

49
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,120
Are you going to say

50
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:14,090
when we were studying musicals together,

51
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:16,079
I was Cast A

52
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,620
and you were Cast B,

53
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:19,240
so

54
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,520
I'll definitely be fine?

55
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,800
I came all this way.

56
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,560
You've said everything I wanted to say.

57
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,960
It's different, Feixin.

58
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:36,320
How long has it been since I stood on stage

59
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,560
as a musical actress?

60
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:43,079
How long has it been since I sang a complete song

61
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:45,450
and finished a whole dance?

62
00:03:49,079 --> 00:03:50,400
I get nervous too.

63
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:51,680
Wait a minute.

64
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:53,930
What did you say?

65
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,220
You're saying that you, Ning Jin,

66
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:01,010
are worried you won't do as well as me, Bai Feixin?

67
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,080
Are you serious?

68
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:08,920
Wait a minute.

69
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:11,120
I get excited whenever you praise me.

70
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:13,080
I can't forget why I came here.

71
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:15,240
All right, don't push your luck.

72
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:21,920
No matter what,

73
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,120
we all believe you can do it.

74
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,080
In my heart,

75
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:28,800
you will always be the brightest star on stage.

76
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,760
Believe in yourself.

77
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,650
You can do it.

78
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:33,320
Okay.

79
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:00,880
Director.

80
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:01,810
Are you okay?

81
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,280
I'm fine.

82
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:03,880
Stop practicing.

83
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:04,610
Take a break.

84
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:05,400
No need.

85
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,260
Keep going.

86
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,540
Still practicing?

87
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,280
I want to practice a bit more.

88
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,460
I'll stay with you.

89
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,159
No need.

90
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,080
I'm rehearsing Nie Xiaoqian's solo dance.

91
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:51,140
I can just practice alone for a while.

92
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,220
Then I'll wait for you over there.

93
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:09,760
You know what?

94
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,560
Then after we parted, he told me,

95
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,000
You know what?

96
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,080
Actually,

97
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:19,210
I've been trying very hard to control myself too.

98
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,160
Then he left.

99
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,360
You know what kind of person I am.

100
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,960
I really wanted to pull him back,

101
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:24,560
but I...

102
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,690
but I didn't think it was appropriate.

103
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,560
Feixin,

104
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:29,320
trust me.

105
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,560
I've seen so many of your boyfriends.

106
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:34,000
I mean, out of all of them,

107
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,800
Leng Yiheng is definitely the most reliable one.

108
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,480
Really?

109
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,320
How could I not know?

110
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:39,000
Stop talking about it.

111
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,600
If you say any more, I'm going to get nervous again.

112
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,080
Come on, take a deep breath.

113
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,720
Deep breath.

114
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:49,000
Stop worrying about me.

115
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:49,860
What about you?

116
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,400
When are you going to make up?

117
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:59,159
I don't have time to think about that right now.

118
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:02,720
Besides, even if

119
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:04,800
I wanted to make up,

120
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,290
do you think he'd still want to?

121
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:12,120
After all, I was the one who brought up the breakup.

122
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,920
What does it matter who brought it up?

123
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,400
Why are you overthinking this?

124
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:17,360
The way Jin Xi looks at you right now,

125
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,220
his eyes are dripping with honey.

126
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:21,720
He'd come running back if you just beckoned him.

127
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:22,960
Try it if you don't believe me.

128
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:24,280
It's not that simple.

129
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,860
Think about it.

130
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:27,210
After our training ends

131
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,240
and I lose my halo,

132
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,960
will he still look at me the same way?

133
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,200
I think Jin Xi likes you,

134
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:37,680
and it has nothing to do with you being a director.

135
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,680
After spending so much time together,

136
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,000
you must have felt it too.

137
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,720
He's just a very simple person.

138
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,650
You two are the same kind of people.

139
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:47,320
You two are exactly like the lyrics say,

140
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:49,140
a match made in heaven.

141
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,720
One lifetime, one pair.

142
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,880
Are you satisfied?

143
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:04,480
Director.

144
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,080
No.

145
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:06,800
Xiao Qian.

146
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,960
Turn slower when you get here.

147
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:15,360
Okay.

148
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:15,760
Got it.

149
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:05,960
Xiao Qi,

150
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:07,690
which outfit should I wear?

151
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:08,690
This one.

152
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:09,890
Try it on.

153
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:10,610
Alright.

154
00:09:13,680 --> 00:09:14,140
Xiao Qi.

155
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:18,820
Have you guys seen Da Biaojie?

156
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:19,720
No.

157
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:25,440
Jiao Ye,

158
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:27,560
have you seen Da Biaojie?

159
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,490
Right there, rehearsing on stage.

160
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:31,660
More crisp.

161
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,850
Passing a thousand mountains.

162
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:35,600
Sorry, Xiao Qi.

163
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,360
It's fine.

164
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:39,600
You must wait until I turn around to open the fan.

165
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:40,960
Da Biaojie.

166
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:42,400
Da Biaojie.

167
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,080
Okay, got it.

168
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:43,880
Da Biaojie,

169
00:09:43,880 --> 00:09:45,480
Mr. Qiuyu is looking for you.

170
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,280
Just adjust it like this.

171
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,000
Wait for me.

172
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:49,680
Practice well.

173
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,140
Let's move to the next one.

174
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,160
Director,

175
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,800
wait a minute, Xiao Qi.

176
00:09:53,800 --> 00:09:55,880
Lighting tech, help me check the next cue point.

177
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:56,560
Okay, Director.

178
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:56,880
Three, two, one.

179
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:58,600
Three, two, one.

180
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:01,600
As long as there's no problem.

181
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,360
What's wrong, Xiao Qi?

182
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,880
Mr. Qingsong asked

183
00:10:03,880 --> 00:10:06,410
if Jin Xi could go practice the moves with him.

184
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:07,280
No problem at all.

185
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:08,280
We've tried it so many times.

186
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:09,010
You go first.

187
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:11,080
Jin Xi.

188
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:12,200
Let's go.

189
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:15,200
I'll take you to practice the moves with Mr. Qingsong.

190
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:39,840
Publisher/Producer: Wu Qiming

191
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,640
Director's Special Appearance

192
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:21,480
Did you get in touch?

193
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,320
Why hasn't he come yet?

194
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,360
We've been waiting forever.

195
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,000
Any luck?

196
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,480
Did you reach Jin Xi?

197
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:26,760
He's not answering his phone.

198
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,420
He didn't answer mine either.

199
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,800
What about you guys? Any news of Jin Xi?

200
00:11:30,800 --> 00:11:31,600
No.

201
00:11:32,160 --> 00:11:33,280
Nope.

202
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:34,800
Oh my God.

203
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:37,760
Don't do anything crazy at a time like this.

204
00:11:37,920 --> 00:11:38,920
Where did he go?

205
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:39,920
Within half an hour,

206
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,650
if Jin Xi still doesn't show up,

207
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:43,460
Heying,

208
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:45,740
you'll play Ning Caichen.

209
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:47,920
Okay.

210
00:11:48,680 --> 00:11:49,440
I've been ready for a long time.

211
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,040
Sorry.

212
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:52,490
Pretend I didn't say anything.

213
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,680
Where have you been?

214
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:55,410
We couldn't reach you by phone.

215
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:57,820
My phone died, so I didn't get your calls.

216
00:11:58,560 --> 00:11:59,440
Sorry, guys.

217
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:00,360
I'm late.

218
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,200
Glad you're back.

219
00:12:04,880 --> 00:12:05,480
Everyone,

220
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:08,560
tonight is our first performance.

221
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,800
I believe you're all ready.

222
00:12:11,880 --> 00:12:13,880
Stay calm and be safe.

223
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:15,530
Understood?

224
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:16,530
Understood.

225
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:17,770
Let's go.

226
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:19,530
Hurry up.

227
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:23,800
Xiyin Troupe,

228
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,560
let's go!

229
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:26,920
Let's go!

230
00:12:28,120 --> 00:12:29,200
All departments, get ready.

231
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:31,200
The audience will be coming in soon.

232
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:33,690
Where did you go?

233
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:36,520
I got you a relaxation talisman.

234
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:42,480
Xiao Qian.

235
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:45,320
Good luck.

236
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:47,960
You too,

237
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:48,760
Caichen.

238
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,600
Don't worry, Mr. Leng.

239
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:12,600
The Chairman will definitely come.

240
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:18,320
Here.

241
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:47,160
Don't tell my Young Master I'm here.

242
00:13:58,200 --> 00:14:02,000
I've been traveling non-stop for three days and three nights.

243
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:04,560
I haven't had a good sleep.

244
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:06,580
I was with my Young Master.

245
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:07,440
Jin Xi.

246
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:10,000
You really are the male lead

247
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,880
with the worst basic skills I've ever guided.

248
00:14:11,880 --> 00:14:13,000
Take your time.

249
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,120
But you work hard enough.

250
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:14,720
Forget it.

251
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:17,000
Since I've arrived at this precious place,

252
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,080
Folks,

253
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,680
what delicious food do you have for me?

254
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:20,320
Thank you,

255
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,380
Brother Qingsong.

256
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:22,320
Roast duck.

257
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,800
Alright.

258
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:25,100
This is delicious.

259
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:27,400
It makes my mouth water just hearing about it.

260
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:27,760
Wait.

261
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:28,200
Come on.

262
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,360
It seems my Young Master is here.

263
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:31,720
I won't talk to you for now.

264
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:32,450
I'm leaving.

265
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:36,560
Right here.

266
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:01,880
If my soul scatters,

267
00:20:04,560 --> 00:20:06,960
you will also turn to ashes.

268
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:11,560
Every extra day that scholar spends with you

269
00:20:11,600 --> 00:20:14,920
brings him one step closer to hell.

270
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:30,960
Xiaoqian.

271
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:35,800
I don't understand why you won't let me stay here with you.

272
00:20:36,160 --> 00:20:37,220
Swordsman Yan said

273
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:40,020
I have committed too many sins

274
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:43,000
and must cultivate in Lanruo Temple for ten years

275
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:45,130
before I can reshape my physical body.

276
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:48,400
And during these ten years,

277
00:20:48,760 --> 00:20:51,480
I am not allowed to have any contact with mortals.

278
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:52,210
Don't worry.

279
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:54,400
In ten years,

280
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:57,450
I will definitely come here to get you.

281
00:20:58,360 --> 00:20:59,090
From then on,

282
00:21:00,080 --> 00:21:01,740
we will never leave each other

283
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,280
for the rest of our lives.

284
00:21:03,280 --> 00:21:03,920
Caichen.

285
00:21:05,560 --> 00:21:06,220
For my sake,

286
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:09,200
you must take good care of yourself.

287
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:10,960
I will.

288
00:24:06,560 --> 00:24:07,240
Caichen.

289
00:24:09,200 --> 00:24:10,530
See you in the next life.

290
00:24:17,560 --> 00:24:18,400
Xiaoqian.

291
00:24:19,280 --> 00:24:21,010
